    <h2>Our home market. Our operational foundation.</h2>
    <p>With Kochi as its headquarters, Yentrans coordinates freight forwarding, customs-related processes and inland transport through its Indian operating network.</p>

    <h2>A connection point for Gulf trade.</h2>
    <p>Our UAE operations support relevant freight and logistics coordination for cargo moving through regional and international trade routes.</p>

    <h2>Regional execution on the ground.</h2>
    <p>Our Oman presence supports logistics activity in an important Gulf trading market.</p>

    <h2>Partnerships extend the route.</h2>
    <p>Where a shipment travels beyond our own locations, we coordinate with shipping lines and appropriate destination partners. The aim is continuity of information and clearly defined responsibilities, not the suggestion that we own offices in every destination.</p>
